Occurrence labels and stroke membership come from Make Me a Hanzi dictionary.txt,
decomposition and matches fields, commit 618dbab8a8ddefb958763c8b4afbaa741a4460de.
The dictionary derives from Unihan and CJKlib. The upstream COPYING and complete
LGPL/GPL texts, including the upstream Unicode notice, are preserved.

Modifications include occurrence extraction, indexed component membership,
lossless HZB1 command/median encoding, indexes and platform compression/sharding.
Stroke geometry/order, radical flags, repeated components and unmapped strokes
are preserved. The complete enriched source is tools/fixtures/source-data.json.gz;
tools/fixtures/source-manifest.json records the original source hashes.
